  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support local civil society to promote improvement in the governance of the extractive industries, including through participation in and implementation of the Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative (EITI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support local civil society to promote improvement in the governance of the extractive industries, including through participation in and implementation of the Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative (EITI) is a component of Accelerated Reform Facility (ARF) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;323,837. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
